# IBM Content Manager credential template
# Copy to conf/cmbicmenv.ini and keep the resulting file untracked.
#
# The value format is IBM CM specific. Any encoded value remains a credential
# and must be protected like a plaintext password.
#
# Example placeholders only:
# SOURCE_SSID=(ENCODED_USER_AND_PASSWORD)
# DEST_SSID=(ENCODED_USER_AND_PASSWORD)
